        <p>LORD CARRICK says "HomoczA" cured him of bleeding piles, when all else failed: that he gave some to a labourer who was lamed by a stone falling upon him, whom it cured. A woman had a pain in the elbow and could not bend it Z 0 4"13 for a year, and it cured her, l' fp and another used it for scurvy on her leg, and it was doing her good. One letter closes from him with the words, "It is the most won- derful stuff that I ever came across." LORD COMBERMERE says " Homocs:A " did him more good than any embrocation he had ever used for rheumatism.</p>
        <p>Remember that , "Homocrte." subdues inflammation and allays irritation al- most as soon as applied. ,All wholesale houses !took "HOMOCEA.." It ean be obtained from Chemists and others at Is. lid. or 2s. 9d. per box, or will be sent by post for is. 3d. and 35., from the Wholesale Agency, 21, Hamilton Square, Birkenhead.</p>
